        "TileImage": "$($repository b74aa702-d3e5-47fd-9f8a-da58a9588249).Image",
        "Description": "Back where it all began. This should be it, 56. If not, well, I&apos;ll contact you if I&apos;m not dead after this. But after this, the Kamera should be done. A friend of ours has located one of the Kamera&apos;s most high clearance members. Irfaan Zamani is stationed at the Burj Al-Ghazali penthouse, posing as a staff member. However, some personnel of the tower know of his importance, and will shoot you on sight if you are caught doing anything unordinary. Terminal. -V\r(End of Kamera Initiative Act One)",
